{"3491290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unblinking", "steam_appid": 3491290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Unblinking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind-bending puzzle game where the line between reality and madness becomes blurred. Solve increasingly difficult puzzles and  prepare yourself to face the horrors lurking within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into Eldritch Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand on the edge of an unfathomable abyss, with the weight of mortality looming over you... a condemned death row inmate forced to play a twisted survival game, navigating a maze composed of cubes... but not just any cubes. On all six sides, they are each  adorned with unblinking eyes that stare back at you like cold calculating sentinels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spark of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can successfully navigate this twisted, ever changing nightmare and recover the relic, you will be granted back your freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome the eldritch horrors within Unblinking, or will you succumb to madness and despair? <i>You have only one way to find out.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 puzzles to break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique, eldritch twist on traditional puzzle solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling atmosphere and sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex challenges as you delve deeper into the angel's body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, thought-provoking narrative that explores themes of mortality, madness, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own avatar.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Unblinking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind-bending puzzle game where the line between reality and madness becomes blurred. Solve increasingly difficult puzzles and  prepare yourself to face the horrors lurking within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into Eldritch Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand on the edge of an unfathomable abyss, with the weight of mortality looming over you... a condemned death row inmate forced to play a twisted survival game, navigating a maze composed of cubes... but not just any cubes. On all six sides, they are each  adorned with unblinking eyes that stare back at you like cold calculating sentinels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Spark of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can successfully navigate this twisted, ever changing nightmare and recover the relic, you will be granted back your freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome the eldritch horrors within Unblinking, or will you succumb to madness and despair? <i>You have only one way to find out.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 puzzles to break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique, eldritch twist on traditional puzzle solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling atmosphere and sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex challenges as you delve deeper into the angel's body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, thought-provoking narrative that explores themes of mortality, madness, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own avatar.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Inspired by the cult classic 'Intelligent Qube', this bite-sized puzzle game is a love letter to fans of challenging, brain-twisting fun. Can you solve your way out of the death row?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><str